  "changelog": "面板改成逐条请求日志：一条请求一行（时间/模型/落点/备选/缓存/成本/校验），保留最近 60 条；模型名不再截断，面板加宽到 1040。",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/moyunliuyin/pi-desktop-cline-upstream",
  "repository": "https://github.com/moyunliuyin/pi-desktop-cline-upstream"
